{"images":[{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/DL380%20Gen10/HPE%20ProLiant%20DL380%20Gen10%20Server-476x476.jpg.webp","alt":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","width":476,"height":476}],"thumbs":[],"labels":[],"banner":{"href":null,"image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Slider%20Image/DCORE-Home-delivery-1040x200.jpg.webp","alt":"Home Delivery","width":0,"height":0}},"title":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","stats":[{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Regular Price :","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 799","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"HPE","href":"/hpe","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"DL380 Gen10","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-sku","label":"SKU:","value":"Refurbished","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"","old":"","single":"","tax":"","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":true,"productId":"799","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: DL380 Gen10","c":[]},{"h":"Server Type: Rack Server","c":[]},{"h":"Form Factor: 2U","c":[]},{"h":"Processor: Intel Xeon Scalable Processor Family","c":[]},{"h":"Memory: DDR4 HPE SmartMemory","c":[]},{"h":"DIMM Slots: Up to 24","c":[]},{"h":"Drive Options: SFF / LFF configurations","c":[]},{"h":"Storage: SAS / SATA / NVMe options","c":[]},{"h":"RAID: HPE Smart Array controller options","c":[]},{"h":"Power Supply: Redundant PSU options","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server is a high-performance 2U enterprise rack server built for demanding business and data center workloads. Its scalable architecture provides a flexible combination of computing power, memory capacity, storage, networking, and expansion options.</p><p><br></p><p>Powered by Intel Xeon Scalable processors, the DL380 Gen10 supports DDR4 HPE SmartMemory for demanding applications such as virtualization, databases, cloud platforms, enterprise software, and large-scale data processing.</p><p><br></p><p>The DL380 Gen10 offers flexible storage configurations with support for different drive form factors and storage technologies depending on the selected chassis and controller configuration. HPE iLO 5 provides comprehensive remote management, monitoring, and server administration capabilities.</p><p><br></p><p>With its 2U design and broad configuration options, the HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 is suitable for businesses, data centers, service providers, and organizations looking for a scalable enterprise server platform.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 2U Rack Server</li><li>Intel Xeon Scalable processor support</li><li>DDR4 HPE SmartMemory</li><li>Up to 24 DIMM slots</li><li>Flexible LFF and SFF storage configurations</li><li>SAS, SATA and NVMe storage options depending on configuration</li><li>HPE Smart Array RAID controller support</li><li>HPE iLO 5 remote management</li><li>PCIe expansion capabilities</li><li>Multiple networking options</li><li>Redundant power supply support</li><li>Scalable storage and compute architecture</li><li>Enterprise-grade security and management</li><li>Designed for high-density data center deployment</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"HP ProLiant DL180 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl180-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380 Gen9","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380-gen9","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380P Gen8 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380p-gen8-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL360 Gen